<p>(Hussain hussain hussain) x3</p>

<p>(Mere lahu ke har qatre mei gunj raha hai ya Hussain, ab to sabka vird zubaa(n) bhi rehna laga hai ya Hussain) x2</p>

<ol>
 <li>Aap ki kya shaan hai maula, bolta quran hai maula
